### WorldValuesBench

The 16 WVS probe questions and their answer scales follow the WorldValuesBench
probe set, for comparability with prior work. No WorldValuesBench files are
redistributed here; the question set and scale endpoints are transcribed into
`experiment/code/config.py`. Please credit the WorldValuesBench project if you
build on that question selection.

    https://github.com/Demon702/WorldValuesBench

